+
+## Known limitations
+
+IRI limited character support: The SPARQL storage backend uses the
+[SPARQL 1.1 Graph Store HTTP Protocol](https://www.w3.org/TR/sparql11-http-rdf-update/).
+This protocol uses the IRI format for identifying graphs. Currently, we do not
+support the collowing characters:
+```
+{} < " | \ ^ ` (space)
+```
